Upstream: LocalAI
Base: v4.10.0 (7ad0cbf259f0c7bf9920fe2438fc3630ecd6c672)
Requires: 0001-chat-response-format-fail-closed.patch
Scope: Open Responses structured output transport only
Purpose: route Responses text.format through the same fail-closed grammar
  helper used by Chat Completions, and reject unsupported or malformed formats
  and structured text.format combined with tools before generation starts.
Unmodified: backend.proto, compute/runtime, tool/function grammar handling.
Note: text.format is canonical; text_format is kept as a legacy alias.
  Supplying both is rejected with HTTP 400.

Apply inside a LocalAI v4.10.0 source checkout from its root, after 0001:
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0001-chat-response-format-fail-closed.patch
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0002-responses-structured-transport.patch

